          "comment": "On dangerous mark but has something to prove and he's untried as a sprinter",
          "spotlight": "Defied this mark at Beverley (8.4f, good to firm) last summer but has mixed record in five runs for current yard and was out the back at Doncaster (7f, good) last month; has something to prove and he's untried as a sprinter.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He showed plenty of promise last year in three runs over a mile, finishing second twice. First time out this year at Haydock, he was probably a bit fresh and finished fourth of the 14 runners over a mile, but he's much better than that. I would suggest readers keep on the right side of him as I think he's on a very decent mark. He's fine over a mile but I can see him doing all right over 1m2f. 01-06-23"
            }
          ],
