          "comment": "Won a Beverley seller last Friday; this is much tougher back in a handicap under a penalty",
          "spotlight": "Has run well in three of his four previous visits here and showed the ability remains when winning at Beverley (8.5f, good to firm) last Friday, but that was a seller in which he was favoured by the weights; this will be much tougher back in a handicap under a penalty.",
