          "comment": "Progressive 7f handicapper but steps up a couple of levels here",
          "spotlight": "Progressive handicapper won over this trip at Fairyhouse last term and again on latest of three starts this season, beating late-finishing Dance Night Andday comfortably over same trip in Curragh premier fillies' tries again in stakes company but much more required.",
