              "quote": "It's lovely to get my first Flat winner out of the way. Bellaphina had two nice runs under her belt and we knew she had a lot of improvement in her, but the ground was a concern. She had sore shins after her last run and we will see how she comes out of this, ideally she would want better ground - John Andrew Kinsella - trainer."
