              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "When the draw came out 20 I said 'oh no', Our minds were made up that we had to drop in. The pace was strong, one of the fractions was 10 seconds. Maybe the couple of front-runners holding up earlier in the day encouraged the lads to go forward. It suited Dance Night Andday and Ronnie was unbelievable on her - Ross O'Sullivan, trainer."
