              "quote": "I've always thought Temperance would be a black-type filly but couldn't win my maiden. I kept coming up against 90-rated horses, so I said we'd just go for a handicap. The last day I ran her back a bit too quickly and I saw it wasn't the thing to do. Everyone keeps preaching that she wants seven furlongs. I don't disagree as I think she could stay seven but I think six is her trip - Kate McGivern, trainer."
