          "comment": "Badly hampered when behind some of today's rivals last time; chance",
          "spotlight": "Good runs in hot handicaps last summer; returned from a break with a good fourth at the Curragh in May, behind subsequent Listed winner, Skukuza (1m, good); badly hampered inside final 2f at the Curragh last time (1m, good) when behind Love Billy Boy and the winner, Slieve Binnian.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-08-26",
              "horse": "Coeur d'Or",
              "horse_id": "hrs_12240802",
              "race": "Paddy Power Supporting Cancer Trials Ireland Irish Cambridgeshire (Premier Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11018709",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Coeur d'Or is just a very tough, genuine and game horse. In his younger days he was a very immature horse but I gave him plenty of time and now it's paying dividends. He loves to come from off the pace and is very consistent. He will step up a couple of furlongs and come back here on Champions Weekend for the Northfields Handicap - Dermot Weld, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-08-01",
              "horse": "Coeur d'Or",
              "horse_id": "hrs_12240802",
              "race": "COLM QUINN BMW Mile Handicap (Premier Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11002979",
              "course": "Galway",
              "course_id": "crs_4758",
              "distance_f": "8.5",
              "distance_y": "1892",
              "quote": "Coeur D'or has been a very consistent all year. He is a very brave horse. We were a little worried about the ground, but this has been the plan and the horse delivered. He took a lot of time to come to hand but patience paid dividends - Dermot Weld, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-06-08",
              "horse": "Coeur d'Or",
              "horse_id": "hrs_12240802",
              "race": "Plusvital Speed Gene Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10956322",
              "course": "Leopardstown",
              "course_id": "crs_4862",
              "distance_f": "9",
              "distance_y": "1980",
              "quote": "Coeur D'Or got an easy lead, they went no pace, and it worked out well. Chris kicked off the front end and he won well, it was a super ride - Dermot Weld, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-09-08",
              "horse": "Coeur d'Or",
              "horse_id": "hrs_12240802",
              "race": "Pride Of Place Maiden",
              "race_id": "rac_10671375",
              "course": "Laytown",
              "course_id": "crs_4836",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "Coeur D'Or has done a few different things with him at home and we thought coming here might give him a new lease of life. He toughed it out well - Chris Hayes, rider."
            }
          ],
