          "comment": "Two good efforts on turf recently; seven-time winner on AW at 7f-1m",
          "spotlight": "Seven-time AW winner at 7f-1m; two good efforts on turf recently; finished 3.25l third over C&D in June (soft); followed that with a 2.5l third behind the same rival at the Curragh later that month (1m2f, good); he is better on AW surface.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "This colt is so genuine and has given everyone a lot of fun with five wins from nine starts, which reads even better on the all-weather having a five from seven record. He does not go well on the grass so we will continue to race him on the artificial surface. He has risen through the ranks where he now finds himself with a rating of 93. There is a race at Wolverhampton on May 18 while there is a 1m2f option at Lingfield in mid-June. I would love to try him over 1m2f soon as I feel the extra trip could bring out improvement in him and add to his already commendable winning record. 28-04-21"
            }
          ],
