          "comment": "Premier handicap winner last time; up 5lb and a number of his rivals unlucky that day",
          "spotlight": "Winner of a premier handicap at the Curragh last time (1m, good); had a number of today's rivals behind him on that occasion; consistent runs prior to his recent win; up 5lb and a number of those in behind him didn't get a clear run that day so he could be vulnerable.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-29",
              "horse": "Slieve Binnian",
              "horse_id": "hrs_31083122",
              "race": "Dubai Duty Free Derby Festival Handicap (Premier Handicap)",
              "race_id": "rac_11674741",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Mick [Halford] recommended us and I've known Paul Rooney for a long time. He's one of the biggest gentlemen in racing. Slieve Binnian ran really well on Guineas weekend and we put him away for this and it came together. He's a lovely horse and could be a Galway Mile horse and will need to go up a few pounds to get in, so we'll see what the handicapper does with him. I'd like to have a go at Galway. He hasn't had many goes at a mile. He took a while to get going the last day but came home well and sharpened up a lot from it - David Marnane, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-10-20",
              "horse": "Slieve Binnian",
              "horse_id": "hrs_31083122",
              "race": "Gateway Hotel Dundalk Race & Stay Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11080706",
              "course": "Dundalk (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_29588",
              "distance_f": "10.5",
              "distance_y": "2350",
              "quote": "Slieve Binnian did that well. He jumped and travelled and hit the line well, he is definitely on the up. He jumps quick and you can put him anywhere in a race - Ronan Whelan, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-08-19",
              "horse": "Slieve Binnian",
              "horse_id": "hrs_31083122",
              "race": "Holden Plant Rental Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11018540",
              "course": "Curragh",
              "course_id": "crs_4628",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2200",
              "quote": "Slieve Binnian was in such good form all week that I let him take his chance. He's a lovely, gebuine horse and that's a good trip for him - Michael Halford, joint trainer"
            }
          ],
