          "comment": "Hurdles/Flat winner; good second over 1m recently; extra furlong here to suit",
          "spotlight": "A winner over hurdles and on the Flat; good second at Bellewstown over 1m earlier this month (good); the extra furlong of this race is a positive; due to go up 1lb in the future.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-10-12",
              "horse": "Cleopatra's Needle",
              "horse_id": "hrs_24770564",
              "race": "Frank Lynch & Co Chartered Certified Accountants Supporting Louth GAA Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_11425011",
              "course": "Fairyhouse",
              "course_id": "crs_4732",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "It was Cleopatra's Needle's first run in a handicap and Sean was very good on her. He put her to sleep and was the last one to get into it. She's not a bad filly and she likes jumping. She showed a bit early on on the Flat and she was unlucky not to win three in a row. Then things just went wrong with her, she's a hard mare to keep right - Harry Rogers, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-05-07",
              "horse": "Cleopatra's Needle",
              "horse_id": "hrs_24770564",
              "race": "Book Your Navan Summer BBQ Packages Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "rac_11279086",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2200",
              "quote": "Cleopatra's Needle worked very well last week but she always did work well and is a well-bred mare. She loves top of the ground and she's going jumping as she has schooled over hurdles. Robbie Power had her for a while, schooling her, and said she had plenty of scope - Harry Rogers, trainer."
            }
          ],
